s":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"CVmzqrekI1iYHio8pTyTpA","review_id":"RsxmM2fBJDXZL8fiumryQw","date":"2018-07-24T18:38:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9430716037750244,"text_excerpt":"Surrey's is the absolute best. It's easily one of my favorite breakfast spots in New Orleans, and I recommend it to people all the time. Both locations have such fun vibes - they are small and quirky and decorated with local New Orleans art (stop by the Uptown location for one of their shotgun house pieces of art). I find that the waiters too are always kind and seem like they enjoy working there. Highlights here I think are the Banana Pancake (it's HUGE, so definitely good to order for the table so you can all share and get your own dish - that's always my move). The Crab Omelette, the Roasted Veggie Omelette, the Migas, and the French Toast. I found that the Breakfast Burrito is a littl..."},{"business_id":"CVmzqrekI1iYHio8pTyTpA","review_id":"iE2TjfF-YN34DIA0YxoZ1Q","date":"2015-08-04T22:40:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9373146295547485,"text_excerpt":"Love love love this place. We had been to the other Surrey's and decided to see if this place is the same. I love the inside! It's roomier. We sat at the breakfast bar! I had banana fosters french toast! Delicious! I always get my sauces on the side so I don't eat soggy bread! They use the french bread to make the french toast and inside the french toast has banana puree! It was delicious indeed. I also tried their homemade juices, apple juice with ginger juice added. Talk about sweet and spicy. I wanted something with low acidity b/c my tummy had to recover from issues during the week. Ginger helps sooth my tummy! My apple juice was just as delicious with or with ginger added. I got my i..."},{"business_id":"CVmzqrekI1iYHio8pTyTpA","review_id":"48xgmMISMWClsDRITTXmBw","date":"2016-06-19T18:22:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9349629878997803,"text_excerpt":"Since I usually go to the *other* Surrey's and it's usually packed, I decided to check this one out instead. Although there was a wait, we didn't wait for nearly as long and the \"half hour\" estimate they gave us turned out to be only 10 minutes. We were seated inside and we were waited on and served pretty quickly, because they are eager to get people in and out on a busy Sunday. Of course, I got my favorite- shrimp and grits. I am not lying when I say that the shrimp and grits here might be my favorite in the city. They are just so perfectly creamy and good, and the croutons and bacon that the dish comes with are a perfect touch. I finished the entire bowl of this delicious goodness and ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"CVmzqrekI1iYHio8pTyTpA","photo_id":"ooP_M79jg8OHWyP9W84Lcw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ooP_M79jg8OHWyP9W84Lcw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.889884352684021},{"business_id":"CVmzqrekI1iYHio8pTyTpA","photo_id":"emXdCjPAYU0nLoFX2fYETg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/emXdCjPAYU0nLoFX2fYETg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7643193006515503},{"business_id":"CVmzqrekI1iYHio8pTyTpA","photo_id":"oNmuEAuQtkZqHT1b6qtMyA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/oNmuEAuQtkZqHT1b6qtMyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.717156708240509},{"business_id":"CVmzqrekI1iYHio8pTyTpA","photo_id":"xGkfRisFtpM36N1ehVibBA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xGkfRisFtpM36N1ehVibBA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7074276208877563},{"business_id":"CVmzqrekI1iYHio8pTyTpA","photo_id":"v1FiaT8pzl2d2wTwenm1DQ","la